<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>MacMenuBar.com (中文)</title><link>https://macmenubar.com</link><description>一个收录了1600多款Mac菜单栏应用的精选目录。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 12:31:27 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>AI配额</title><link>https://macmenubar.com/aiquota/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AIQuota.webp"&gt;&lt;img alt="AIQuota" height="425" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AIQuota.webp" width="450"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
